1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:04,879
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:11,010 --> 00:00:12,053
<i>I hate you!</i>

3
00:00:12,137 --> 00:00:14,305
<i>I did everything to make you mine!</i>

4
00:00:14,389 --> 00:00:15,807
[Nimfa] <i>I let her control me!</i>

5
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:17,392
-[Diego] <i>Nimfa!</i>
-<i>I became a bad person!</i>

6
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:18,643
[Diego] <i>What did you say?</i>

7
00:00:18,727 --> 00:00:19,811
[Diego] <i>Ivy, I don't know how</i>

8
00:00:19,894 --> 00:00:21,604
<i>Nimfa could do this to me, either.</i>

9
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,273
<i>That's why we shouldn't allow them to win.</i>

10
00:00:23,356 --> 00:00:24,107
<i>You need to mislead Emilia.</i>

11
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:26,735
<i>She can't discover your true identity.</i>

12
00:00:26,818 --> 00:00:28,528
<i>We're going to hunt Lily Cruz.</i>

13
00:00:28,611 --> 00:00:31,448
[woman] <i>Haven't you heard?</i>
<i>Emilia's nabbing all the women</i>

14
00:00:31,531 --> 00:00:33,199
<i>who are the same age as Lily Cruz.</i>

15
00:00:33,783 --> 00:00:35,660
[Ivy] <i>What will you do to them?</i>
<i>Where are you taking them?</i>

16
00:00:35,744 --> 00:00:38,455
[Emilia] <i>I won't do anything</i>
<i>today that you won't like.</i>

17
00:00:38,538 --> 00:00:40,373
[Camia] <i>You're going to kidnap the women</i>

18
00:00:40,457 --> 00:00:43,001
<i>here to find Lily Cruz.</i>

19
00:00:43,084 --> 00:00:46,796
<i>Yes, Emilia. I know all about</i>
<i>your dirty games.</i>

20
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:48,173
<i>Boys, now!</i>

21
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:50,175
[Camia] <i>Fine, Emilia.</i>

22
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:53,094
<i>Because I don't want</i>
<i>these people to get hurt,</i>

23
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:54,220
<i>I'll come with you.</i>

24
00:00:54,304 --> 00:00:56,347
[Emilia] <i>Is Lily alive?! Where is she?!</i>

25
00:00:56,431 --> 00:00:58,433
[Camia] <i>Yes, Lily is alive!</i>

26
00:00:58,516 --> 00:00:59,893
[Emilia] <i>Will she resurface?</i>

27
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:01,311
<i>Is she going to press charges?</i>

28
00:01:01,394 --> 00:01:04,564
<i>Lily will not resurface.</i>
<i>I promise you that.</i>

29
00:01:04,647 --> 00:01:07,025
[Camia] <i>The Ardientes already know</i>
<i>that Lily is still alive.</i>

30
00:01:07,108 --> 00:01:09,402
<i>I think I need to talk to my daughter.</i>

31
00:01:09,486 --> 00:01:12,322
[Nimfa] <i>I'm sure about this,</i>
<i>Ma'am Emilia. Lily's coming.</i>

32
00:01:12,405 --> 00:01:15,241
[Emilia] <i>Take a video, and send</i>
<i>it to me immediately.</i>

33
00:01:15,325 --> 00:01:17,494
<i>If you pull that off, you're free to go.</i>

34
00:01:17,577 --> 00:01:18,328
<i>Good job.</i>

35
00:01:18,411 --> 00:01:19,329
[Nimfa cries]

36
00:01:19,412 --> 00:01:22,457
[Camia] <i>Let go of me!</i>
<i>How dare you! You liar!</i>

37
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:24,042
<i>How could you do this?</i>
<i>What were you thinking?</i>

38
00:01:24,125 --> 00:01:26,711
<i>Emilia promised to give me a better life.</i>

39
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:27,587
<i>I was blinded by it…</i>

40
00:01:27,670 --> 00:01:30,507
<i>Emilia promised me</i>
<i>you'd be mine after all this.</i>

41
00:01:30,590 --> 00:01:31,841
<i>Well, she lied to you!</i>

42
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:35,428
<i>I did all this hoping</i>
<i>I could make you love me, Diego!</i>

43
00:01:35,512 --> 00:01:37,472
[Nimfa] <i>But you only have eyes for Ivy…</i>

44
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:38,681
<i>for Lily.</i>

45
00:01:39,516 --> 00:01:41,059
[Nimfa] <i>You're being nice to me</i>

46
00:01:41,142 --> 00:01:42,811
<i>so I won't push through with my plan.</i>

47
00:01:42,894 --> 00:01:46,731
<i>I'm still telling Emilia about</i>
<i>the information I discovered!</i>

48
00:01:46,815 --> 00:01:48,066
<i>Get out of my way!</i>

49
00:01:48,149 --> 00:01:49,150
<i>Nimfa!</i>

50
00:01:50,485 --> 00:01:54,614
[all] <i>♪ Happy birthday, happy birthday ♪</i>

51
00:01:55,115 --> 00:02:00,286
<i>♪ Happy birthday to you ♪</i>

52
00:02:01,496 --> 00:02:03,623
Cheers! Thank you, thank you!

53
00:02:03,706 --> 00:02:05,125
[clapping and cheering]

54
00:02:05,208 --> 00:02:06,793
[Carlito] Have your seats, everybody.

55
00:02:07,335 --> 00:02:08,711
Tonight, let us celebrate.

56
00:02:09,212 --> 00:02:11,172
And so, let us forget about politics.

57
00:02:11,506 --> 00:02:13,758
All right? Just for tonight. [chuckles]

58
00:02:13,842 --> 00:02:17,679
And, help yourselves
to some drinks and some food.

59
00:02:17,762 --> 00:02:19,889
Let's have fun.
All right. Enjoy the night.

60
00:02:19,973 --> 00:02:21,891
[clapping]

61
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:32,068
[cha-cha music playing]

62
00:02:32,694 --> 00:02:34,612
[Emilia] Come on.
Let's go up to the senator.

63
00:02:34,696 --> 00:02:37,365
I'm sure he still remembers me
from our Paris trip.

64
00:02:37,448 --> 00:02:39,117
I was still a governor then.

65
00:02:40,201 --> 00:02:41,870
Hold on. Just stay there. You stay.

66
00:02:41,953 --> 00:02:43,454
You're too excited. Relax.

67
00:02:43,538 --> 00:02:45,373
But, we shouldn't waste this opportunity

68
00:02:45,456 --> 00:02:46,833
to win his endorsement!

69
00:02:46,916 --> 00:02:49,544
Emilia! <i>Cállate!</i>

70
00:02:51,588 --> 00:02:53,131
Act like an Ardiente.

71
00:02:54,048 --> 00:02:56,050
[Julio] We don't approach people…

72
00:02:56,801 --> 00:02:58,887
people approach us.

73
00:03:00,305 --> 00:03:03,933
[cha-cha music continues playing]

74
00:03:13,651 --> 00:03:14,444
[Nimfa panting]

75
00:03:14,527 --> 00:03:17,614
Out of my way! Let me go! Out of my way!

76
00:03:17,697 --> 00:03:18,907
-Nimfa!
-I said out of my way!

77
00:03:18,990 --> 00:03:21,034
-Don't let her go!
-Let go of me!

78
00:03:21,117 --> 00:03:22,368
[crying]

79
00:03:22,452 --> 00:03:25,496
Just let me go! I said let me go!

80
00:03:26,205 --> 00:03:27,582
[Nimfa crying]

81
00:03:38,885 --> 00:03:40,511
[Carlito] Thank you for coming
to my birthday.

82
00:03:40,595 --> 00:03:41,346
[guest] Thank you.

83
00:03:41,429 --> 00:03:42,555
Senator!

84
00:03:43,723 --> 00:03:44,557
[Carlito] Ah.

85
00:03:44,641 --> 00:03:47,143
[cha-cha music playing]

86
00:03:47,477 --> 00:03:48,645
Governor Emilia.

87
00:03:48,728 --> 00:03:52,607
Happy birthday, Senator.
What a lovely party.

88
00:03:52,690 --> 00:03:53,441
Thank you.

89
00:03:53,524 --> 00:03:56,152
How can I forget your birthday?
And you, Senator.

90
00:03:56,236 --> 00:03:59,197
I made sure to include
your thrust on national security

91
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:02,033
and tourism in my platform.

92
00:04:02,116 --> 00:04:05,453
Of course. How could I forget,
Governor Emilia?

93
00:04:06,079 --> 00:04:08,414
You copied Victorino's platform too.

94
00:04:08,873 --> 00:04:13,086
Wasn't he your opponent
in the last election?

95
00:04:13,878 --> 00:04:16,047
[tense music playing]

96
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:17,632
[Carlito] We didn't expect him to win

97
00:04:17,715 --> 00:04:21,678
because your family controls
all of Poblacion Ardiente.

98
00:04:22,887 --> 00:04:24,180
Ah, Miss Aguas.

99
00:04:25,348 --> 00:04:26,307
Senator O!

100
00:04:27,767 --> 00:04:29,602
[Carlito] I thought we'd meet sooner.

101
00:04:30,853 --> 00:04:31,729
[Carlito] Engaged?

102
00:04:31,813 --> 00:04:32,897
Yes.

103
00:04:32,981 --> 00:04:34,983
Who's the lucky guy? [chuckles]

104
00:04:37,694 --> 00:04:40,405
Mayor Arnaldo Ardiente-Torillo, Senator.

105
00:04:41,364 --> 00:04:43,366
Well, I should say this.

106
00:04:44,701 --> 00:04:46,286
Remember when we were
preparing the details

107
00:04:46,369 --> 00:04:48,538
for the low-cost housing project?

108
00:04:48,621 --> 00:04:50,039
-Yes, of course.
-[Carlito] I think…

109
00:04:50,790 --> 00:04:52,709
I should've courted you back then.

110
00:04:55,712 --> 00:04:56,713
[Ivy and Carlito chuckle]

111
00:04:56,796 --> 00:04:58,214
If only, Senator.

112
00:04:58,298 --> 00:05:00,717
But I'm sure my mother
wouldn't have allowed it.

113
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:02,343
[Carlito laughs]

114
00:05:02,427 --> 00:05:05,555
Ouch, that hurt. Point well taken.

115
00:05:13,521 --> 00:05:16,858
[tense music playing]

116
00:05:17,692 --> 00:05:20,194
[crying]

117
00:05:22,488 --> 00:05:25,867
[Emilia] <i>I will lift you out of poverty.</i>

118
00:05:25,950 --> 00:05:29,495
<i>I'll make you a very rich woman.</i>

119
00:05:29,579 --> 00:05:30,830
[Claire] <i>I can guarantee you,</i>

120
00:05:30,913 --> 00:05:35,293
<i>you'll be able to provide</i>
<i>for your father after this.</i>

121
00:05:35,376 --> 00:05:37,670
[Nimfa] <i>You won't just give me the house,</i>

122
00:05:37,754 --> 00:05:39,672
<i>the car, and the money.</i>

123
00:05:40,089 --> 00:05:40,965
<i>Diego.</i>

124
00:05:41,049 --> 00:05:44,177
<i>I want Diego to be mine after all this.</i>

125
00:05:44,677 --> 00:05:46,679
<i>And you'll help me make that happen.</i>

126
00:05:52,894 --> 00:05:58,024
[Diego] <i>Nimfa, wait.</i>
<i>Can we not ruin what we have?</i>

127
00:05:59,317 --> 00:06:00,068
[muffled shriek]

128
00:06:00,151 --> 00:06:01,694
[Diego] <i>Why did you do that?!</i>

129
00:06:02,153 --> 00:06:04,363
<i>Haven't you realized</i>
<i>that they're just using you?</i>

130
00:06:04,447 --> 00:06:07,408
<i>You know Emilia and her family</i>
<i>are murderers and liars!</i>

131
00:06:07,492 --> 00:06:12,330
<i>I did all this hoping</i>
<i>I could make you love me, Diego!</i>

132
00:06:18,628 --> 00:06:20,671
I may have done the wrong thing.

133
00:06:22,131 --> 00:06:24,759
But, there's no turning back now.

134
00:06:35,228 --> 00:06:37,438
[Carlito chuckles] It's an honor
to have you here.

135
00:06:37,522 --> 00:06:39,565
-[Julio] Thank you.
-I'm really flattered, Senator.

136
00:06:39,649 --> 00:06:41,025
[Emilia] You didn't forget about us.

137
00:06:41,109 --> 00:06:42,443
[Carlito] Of course.

138
00:06:43,361 --> 00:06:45,822
Your family is unforgettable.

139
00:06:47,573 --> 00:06:49,909
Especially to the victims
of the human rights violations

140
00:06:49,992 --> 00:06:51,369
you committed.

141
00:06:54,622 --> 00:06:55,915
Excuse me?

142
00:07:00,419 --> 00:07:01,295
[Carlito] Actually,

143
00:07:01,963 --> 00:07:03,756
we have an international publication

144
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:07,051
present to do an in-depth investigation

145
00:07:07,135 --> 00:07:09,595
on the killings your family
is implicated in.

146
00:07:10,721 --> 00:07:11,889
[chuckles]

147
00:07:12,432 --> 00:07:15,476
This is unbelievable, Senator.

148
00:07:22,275 --> 00:07:23,401
[Julio] Anyway…

149
00:07:24,652 --> 00:07:28,281
It's your birthday.
Enjoy your celebration.

150
00:07:28,948 --> 00:07:32,034
[Julio] But right now,
I suggest you shut up.

151
00:07:35,371 --> 00:07:39,625
I know it's your birthday, but I
just might make it your last.

152
00:07:39,709 --> 00:07:42,044
[Ivy] Congressman. Congressman!

153
00:07:42,670 --> 00:07:44,213
Senator.

154
00:07:44,297 --> 00:07:45,381
How about we…

155
00:07:46,757 --> 00:07:50,428
set our pride and our tempers aside…

156
00:07:50,970 --> 00:07:52,930
and make this a productive discussion--

157
00:07:53,014 --> 00:07:54,015
[Arnaldo] Ivy.

158
00:07:55,224 --> 00:07:57,685
-[whispers] Don't.
-Hon, it's okay.

159
00:07:57,768 --> 00:08:03,107
Senator, the truth is we came
to ask for your endorsement

160
00:08:03,191 --> 00:08:07,612
so that Arnaldo could join
your party, if you'll allow it.

161
00:08:07,904 --> 00:08:10,031
Well, go on. You know…

162
00:08:10,656 --> 00:08:13,618
[Carlito] Um. I might've said
some harsh words earlier,

163
00:08:13,701 --> 00:08:16,746
but I could learn
to sing a different tune.

164
00:08:18,122 --> 00:08:19,290
[Carlito] If necessary.

165
00:08:20,166 --> 00:08:21,334
[Arnaldo] Excuse me.

166
00:08:23,628 --> 00:08:25,087
-[Julio] Oh, well.
-Excuse me.

167
00:08:26,214 --> 00:08:27,715
[Julio] Well, well.

168
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:32,720
I guess that's our cue
to end this little charade.

169
00:08:33,888 --> 00:08:35,139
[Julio clears throat]

170
00:08:38,184 --> 00:08:41,687
Senator Olivares, thank you very much

171
00:08:41,771 --> 00:08:45,858
for your warm and candid words.

172
00:08:49,362 --> 00:08:51,531
One day, Senator. One day.

173
00:08:52,240 --> 00:08:55,993
I hope before that day comes…

174
00:08:57,703 --> 00:08:59,330
your family will be held accountable…

175
00:08:59,705 --> 00:09:02,333
for all the violations you've committed.

176
00:09:02,416 --> 00:09:03,459
And,

177
00:09:03,543 --> 00:09:05,169
that your province gets back all the money

178
00:09:05,253 --> 00:09:06,462
you stole from them.

179
00:09:07,171 --> 00:09:08,214
Ha.

180
00:09:08,839 --> 00:09:11,300
[Julio] Tell it to the marines, Carlito.

181
00:09:14,387 --> 00:09:17,306
Then again, what makes you
better than us, huh?

182
00:09:18,641 --> 00:09:21,811
Everyone knows that you're the leader…

183
00:09:22,436 --> 00:09:26,607
of the largest drug cartel in the country.

184
00:09:28,276 --> 00:09:31,571
We all have our own territories.

185
00:09:33,281 --> 00:09:34,615
And, please.

186
00:09:35,783 --> 00:09:38,953
Don't give me that
saintly stance and look of yours

187
00:09:39,036 --> 00:09:41,414
just because you've seen differently.

188
00:09:42,999 --> 00:09:44,208
Let's go.

189
00:09:44,875 --> 00:09:48,462
[tense music playing]

190
00:10:00,725 --> 00:10:02,727
[Ivy] Hon. Arnaldo.

191
00:10:03,853 --> 00:10:07,106
I said wait, hon! What's
going on? What's wrong?

192
00:10:07,189 --> 00:10:08,566
What's your relationship with Olivares?

193
00:10:08,649 --> 00:10:09,900
[tense music playing]

194
00:10:09,984 --> 00:10:11,027
Relationship?

195
00:10:11,861 --> 00:10:13,821
Hon, you heard us earlier.

196
00:10:13,904 --> 00:10:16,907
I was just part of his company's
low-cost housing project.

197
00:10:16,991 --> 00:10:17,950
That's it.

198
00:10:19,410 --> 00:10:21,037
Arnaldo, are you jealous again?

199
00:10:21,120 --> 00:10:22,955
-We have to go.
-No!

200
00:10:23,289 --> 00:10:25,750
Not yet. What about your endorsement?

201
00:10:25,833 --> 00:10:27,710
I don't care about the endorsement!

202
00:10:28,794 --> 00:10:31,088
I'll form my own party for all I care,

203
00:10:31,172 --> 00:10:33,215
just stop acting like a cheap whore--

204
00:10:37,553 --> 00:10:40,640
How dare you say that to me?

205
00:10:41,641 --> 00:10:42,850
You dare say that to me

206
00:10:42,933 --> 00:10:46,312
when I'm doing everything I can
to get that endorsement?

207
00:10:51,942 --> 00:10:53,694
WE NEED TO TALK…

208
00:10:56,739 --> 00:10:59,950
[tense music continues playing]

209
00:11:05,206 --> 00:11:07,249
Arnaldo, it's starting to bruise--

210
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:10,086
Shut it. Leave me alone.

211
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,421
Come on, son…

212
00:11:13,255 --> 00:11:17,218
You have every reason to be angry at Ivy.

213
00:11:17,676 --> 00:11:21,472
But she told me she's known
the senator for a long time.

214
00:11:21,555 --> 00:11:24,558
That's why she scored us
invites to this party.

215
00:11:24,642 --> 00:11:27,478
[tense music swells]

216
00:11:30,106 --> 00:11:31,857
Arnaldo, don't get me wrong…

217
00:11:34,443 --> 00:11:36,654
But does your fiancée really love you?

218
00:11:37,738 --> 00:11:41,242
Or worse, maybe she brought
you here to set you up.

219
00:11:41,325 --> 00:11:42,410
Shut up!

220
00:11:42,493 --> 00:11:43,869
Maybe she wants the people
to see you fail!

221
00:11:43,953 --> 00:11:45,037
Shut up!

222
00:11:46,455 --> 00:11:48,290
That's not true!

223
00:11:50,292 --> 00:11:54,755
Okay, go ahead. Follow her!

224
00:11:54,839 --> 00:11:58,843
That way, you'll see that
she doesn't really love you.

225
00:12:04,932 --> 00:12:06,058
Go!

226
00:12:11,021 --> 00:12:12,398
Crazy!

227
00:12:19,864 --> 00:12:23,993
[suspenseful music playing]

228
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,331
Nimfa?

229
00:12:31,125 --> 00:12:32,084
[gasps]

230
00:12:32,168 --> 00:12:35,963
Nimfa, what did you do?
We need to go to the hospital.

231
00:12:36,881 --> 00:12:38,591
Guards! Guards!

232
00:12:39,049 --> 00:12:40,092
Guard!

233
00:12:40,718 --> 00:12:41,552
What is it, ma'am?

234
00:12:41,635 --> 00:12:42,636
Get the car.

235
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:46,015
We need to go to the hospital!
We need to bring Nimfa! Hurry!

236
00:12:46,098 --> 00:12:47,099
Yes, ma'am!

237
00:12:47,725 --> 00:12:50,478
[ominous music playing]

238
00:13:00,362 --> 00:13:02,656
<i>I'll make Emilia pay.</i>

239
00:13:03,741 --> 00:13:05,951
<i>But I need to get out of here first.</i>

240
00:13:07,912 --> 00:13:09,038
[sighs deeply]

241
00:13:10,247 --> 00:13:14,543
<i>Nimfa, think. Use your brain cells.</i>

242
00:13:16,212 --> 00:13:18,923
[tense music playing]

243
00:13:33,479 --> 00:13:34,813
[shatters]

244
00:13:34,897 --> 00:13:35,940
<i>Ah!</i>

245
00:13:46,700 --> 00:13:49,453
[tense music playing]

246
00:13:57,711 --> 00:13:59,713
[tense music swelling]

247
00:14:06,178 --> 00:14:10,724
Nimfa… Nimfa, what did you do?

248
00:14:10,808 --> 00:14:12,601
[whimpers]

249
00:14:12,685 --> 00:14:14,478
I can't take it anymore.

250
00:14:14,562 --> 00:14:15,980
Nimfa, we're here to take care of you.

251
00:14:16,063 --> 00:14:16,939
I can't do it anymore.

252
00:14:17,022 --> 00:14:18,983
We'll take care of you. Come on.

253
00:14:19,066 --> 00:14:24,154
Let's go to the hospital. Come on. Get up!

254
00:14:24,238 --> 00:14:25,823
-[Nimfa] Ma'am Camia…
-[Camia screams]

255
00:14:27,157 --> 00:14:29,410
[Nimfa panting]

256
00:14:31,203 --> 00:14:34,707
Pick up, Emilia. Pick up, Emilia.

257
00:14:35,165 --> 00:14:37,251
[phone rings]

258
00:14:38,544 --> 00:14:40,379
Pick up!

259
00:14:42,047 --> 00:14:43,048
[Julio] Emilia.

260
00:14:45,009 --> 00:14:47,845
Come with me. We're going somewhere.

261
00:14:48,512 --> 00:14:51,265
But I'm not going home yet.
I'm going somewhere.

262
00:14:51,348 --> 00:14:55,895
We aren't going home.
I need to show you something.

263
00:14:55,978 --> 00:14:57,313
[Julio] Now, follow me.

264
00:14:59,064 --> 00:15:00,149
Let's go.

265
00:15:02,401 --> 00:15:05,779
[tense music swells]

266
00:15:15,331 --> 00:15:18,626
[groans] Nimfa? Nimfa!

267
00:15:19,209 --> 00:15:20,544
-Pick up!
-[phone dialing]

268
00:15:20,628 --> 00:15:25,007
[phone ringing]

269
00:15:26,133 --> 00:15:27,593
Hello, Nimfa?

270
00:15:27,676 --> 00:15:28,928
Hello, Ma'am Emilia!

271
00:15:31,013 --> 00:15:34,183
Ma'am Emilia. I know the truth!
Ivy Aguas and Lily--

272
00:15:34,266 --> 00:15:35,517
-No!
-[Nimfa squeals]

273
00:15:35,601 --> 00:15:37,645
What? I can't hear you.

274
00:15:37,728 --> 00:15:39,521
-Give me that!
-No, give it back!

275
00:15:39,605 --> 00:15:42,066
Hello? I'll call you back, okay?

276
00:15:44,151 --> 00:15:45,235
[Claire] What happened?

277
00:15:46,528 --> 00:15:47,821
Give me that!

278
00:15:47,905 --> 00:15:49,823
How dare you make a fool out of me?!

279
00:15:49,907 --> 00:15:52,993
After everything I did for you!

280
00:15:53,077 --> 00:15:53,869
Give me that!

281
00:15:53,953 --> 00:15:57,873
I won't let you go to Emilia!
You can't leave this place!

282
00:15:57,957 --> 00:16:00,084
-[Camia grunts]
-Give me that!

283
00:16:00,167 --> 00:16:05,047
I won't let you tell
the truth to Emilia! [screams]

284
00:16:05,130 --> 00:16:06,757
-Guard!
-Emilia is my only hope…

285
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:08,217
to have a better life!

286
00:16:09,093 --> 00:16:11,595
Ouch! Guard! Guard!

287
00:16:12,179 --> 00:16:13,138
[Camia screams]

288
00:16:13,222 --> 00:16:14,431
[suspenseful music playing]

289
00:16:14,515 --> 00:16:17,559
Nimfa! Nimfa!

290
00:16:18,769 --> 00:16:22,398
Nimfa! Nimfa! Nimfa!

291
00:16:23,691 --> 00:16:27,152
[suspenseful music continues playing]

292
00:16:29,071 --> 00:16:31,198
Nimfa! Nimfa!

293
00:16:31,907 --> 00:16:33,534
[Camia] After her! Hurry!

294
00:16:35,536 --> 00:16:36,704
Nimfa!

295
00:16:40,541 --> 00:16:41,667
[door opens]

296
00:16:43,252 --> 00:16:44,461
[Julio] Yes!

297
00:16:44,878 --> 00:16:51,385
We might need Olivares' help,
but we are not beggars, Emilia.

298
00:16:53,178 --> 00:16:58,183
I just want to show you
how much power and wealth

299
00:16:58,267 --> 00:16:59,309
our family possesses.

300
00:17:01,645 --> 00:17:02,688
Take a look.

301
00:17:05,232 --> 00:17:07,943
With that kind of firepower and money…

302
00:17:10,070 --> 00:17:14,033
we can turn the most innocent soul…

303
00:17:15,117 --> 00:17:20,080
into a hungry, greedy dog
who will do anything for us.

304
00:17:21,081 --> 00:17:23,375
Things that make the world go round.

305
00:17:24,293 --> 00:17:26,628
Guns and money.

306
00:17:28,422 --> 00:17:30,174
And we have them both.

307
00:17:42,311 --> 00:17:43,187
[car door closes]

308
00:17:45,856 --> 00:17:47,483
-Ivy.
-Diego.

309
00:17:55,949 --> 00:17:58,452
[suspenseful music playing]

310
00:17:58,869 --> 00:17:59,953
Ivy, it's Nimfa.

311
00:18:00,662 --> 00:18:03,123
She's the one who told Emilia
that Lily is still alive.

312
00:18:14,051 --> 00:18:16,845
[suspenseful music swells]

313
00:18:52,047 --> 00:18:53,423
[whispers] Arnaldo.

314
00:18:59,680 --> 00:19:01,557
-Arnaldo's here.
-What?!

315
00:19:04,434 --> 00:19:05,435
Hon?

316
00:19:07,187 --> 00:19:10,691
[suspenseful music playing]

317
00:19:12,734 --> 00:19:13,735
Arnaldo.

318
00:19:15,946 --> 00:19:17,531
-Hon.
-We're not doing anything wrong.

319
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:20,868
Hon, I can explain.

320
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,298
Thank you.

321
00:19:35,716 --> 00:19:37,092
-[Diego grunts]
-[Ivy] Arnaldo!

322
00:19:38,719 --> 00:19:39,845
Arnaldo, enough!

323
00:19:40,179 --> 00:19:41,972
[Ivy] Stop it. We should go home.

324
00:19:42,055 --> 00:19:45,893
Arnaldo. I'll tell you why I'm here, hon.

325
00:19:45,976 --> 00:19:47,811
Let's go, hon. Let's go.

326
00:19:49,062 --> 00:19:50,022
Let's go.

327
00:19:51,815 --> 00:19:55,027
[suspenseful music intensifies]

328
00:20:13,253 --> 00:20:16,089
[crickets chirping]

329
00:20:19,801 --> 00:20:20,802
[sighs]

330
00:20:24,056 --> 00:20:26,516
How long have you been meeting with Diego?

331
00:20:26,975 --> 00:20:29,228
[tense music playing]

332
00:20:30,437 --> 00:20:31,688
Answer me.

333
00:20:39,488 --> 00:20:40,697
For a while now.

334
00:20:43,492 --> 00:20:48,038
[tense music playing]

335
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:55,003
So, what were you two doing there?

336
00:20:57,881 --> 00:21:00,676
You were there, weren't you? You saw us.

337
00:21:02,886 --> 00:21:05,973
What you saw was the only thing
we were doing.

338
00:21:06,056 --> 00:21:08,141
We were simply talking.

339
00:21:08,225 --> 00:21:11,353
[scoffs] You were just talking.
Yeah, right. Okay.

340
00:21:15,816 --> 00:21:17,317
What were you talking about, then?

341
00:21:19,695 --> 00:21:22,614
How the two of you
will stab me behind my back?

342
00:21:23,198 --> 00:21:24,199
Am I right?

343
00:21:25,701 --> 00:21:26,910
Tell me.

344
00:21:29,454 --> 00:21:30,372
Hello, Aunt Camia.

345
00:21:31,081 --> 00:21:33,083
<i>I already warned Ivy about Nimfa.</i>

346
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:34,334
I'm on my way there.

347
00:21:34,418 --> 00:21:35,502
[Camia] <i>Diego, don't.</i>

348
00:21:36,211 --> 00:21:37,629
Nimfa got away.

349
00:21:37,713 --> 00:21:39,339
<i>I'm sure she'll go to Emilia</i>

350
00:21:39,423 --> 00:21:42,050
and tell her who Ivy really is.

351
00:21:42,718 --> 00:21:44,136
Diego, you have to stop her.

352
00:21:45,095 --> 00:21:46,305
I will, Aunt Camia.

353
00:21:49,516 --> 00:21:51,727
[tense music playing]

354
00:21:51,810 --> 00:21:53,895
[engine revving up]

355
00:21:58,650 --> 00:21:59,860
This again, huh?

356
00:22:01,987 --> 00:22:02,988
Earlier at the party,

357
00:22:03,071 --> 00:22:08,201
you told me I was acting
like a cheap whore.

358
00:22:08,285 --> 00:22:11,496
Now, you're telling me
I'm cheating on you.

359
00:22:12,122 --> 00:22:13,999
[tense music playing]

360
00:22:14,082 --> 00:22:15,208
Arnaldo, please.

361
00:22:17,502 --> 00:22:22,841
As the woman you promised to
marry and love wholeheartedly…

362
00:22:25,719 --> 00:22:27,345
and as your fiancée…

363
00:22:28,221 --> 00:22:29,514
I assure you…

364
00:22:31,850 --> 00:22:33,518
of my loyalty.

365
00:22:33,602 --> 00:22:35,020
I'm all yours, Arnaldo--

366
00:22:35,103 --> 00:22:36,480
Bullshit!

367
00:22:41,443 --> 00:22:43,445
[breathing heavily]

368
00:22:44,237 --> 00:22:47,783
[tense music swells]

369
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:55,290
Arnaldo, what's with you?

370
00:22:57,375 --> 00:22:59,169
Do we always have to be like this?

371
00:22:59,961 --> 00:23:01,797
Do you always have to be jealous?

372
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:04,633
Do we always have to fight
because of your jealousy?

373
00:23:06,176 --> 00:23:08,637
Earlier, you were jealous of
Senator Olivares.

374
00:23:08,720 --> 00:23:10,597
This time, you're jealous of Diego.

375
00:23:11,807 --> 00:23:16,311
Diego is just a friend.
We aren't what you think we are!

376
00:23:19,481 --> 00:23:23,235
Like I said earlier, he's just a friend.

377
00:23:23,318 --> 00:23:24,319
And you…

378
00:23:26,822 --> 00:23:28,824
I'm all yours, Arnaldo.

379
00:23:30,117 --> 00:23:31,952
I'm all yours.

380
00:23:33,120 --> 00:23:38,458
All yours. Please believe me.
I will be yours forever.

381
00:23:43,421 --> 00:23:46,925
[tense music playing]

382
00:23:48,468 --> 00:23:50,470
[Ivy whimpers]

383
00:23:52,597 --> 00:23:54,891
But it's like you don't believe me…

384
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:58,728
you don't trust me anymore.

385
00:23:59,229 --> 00:24:02,190
Now, you're labeling me as a traitor.

386
00:24:02,566 --> 00:24:04,442
If you don't believe me,

387
00:24:04,526 --> 00:24:06,903
if you think I'm betraying you…

388
00:24:06,987 --> 00:24:10,657
I guess, Arnaldo… Let's just stop this.

389
00:24:12,784 --> 00:24:14,995
We should call off our wedding.

390
00:24:20,083 --> 00:24:24,129
You just broke my heart, Mr. Mayor.

391
00:24:24,838 --> 00:24:28,341
[tense music swells]

392
00:24:40,896 --> 00:24:45,150
Seven, six, five…

393
00:24:46,651 --> 00:24:48,570
Don't disappoint me, Arnaldo.

394
00:24:49,070 --> 00:24:55,160
Four, three, two, and…

395
00:24:57,370 --> 00:24:58,538
[Arnaldo] Ivy!

396
00:25:00,165 --> 00:25:01,541
[Arnaldo sobbing] Ivy!

397
00:25:02,709 --> 00:25:04,044
Ivy, please…

398
00:25:04,753 --> 00:25:06,630
[bawling] Don't leave me! Don't leave me!

399
00:25:07,797 --> 00:25:11,092
Don't leave me! Please. Don't leave me.

400
00:25:12,469 --> 00:25:16,223
I won't let you.
You can't leave me. You can't…

401
00:25:16,306 --> 00:25:18,308
Please don't go!

402
00:25:20,227 --> 00:25:21,978
[sobbing] Please!

403
00:25:24,564 --> 00:25:26,441
No… No, Arnaldo!

404
00:25:27,108 --> 00:25:28,818
-[Arnaldo sniffles]
-You hurt me!

405
00:25:28,902 --> 00:25:30,153
[cries]

406
00:25:30,237 --> 00:25:31,905
I'm sorry. My decision is final.

407
00:25:31,988 --> 00:25:32,822
-[Arnaldo] No. No.
-[Ivy] No!

408
00:25:32,906 --> 00:25:34,741
-I've made up my mind.
-Please, no!

409
00:25:35,242 --> 00:25:37,077
How you're acting…

410
00:25:38,411 --> 00:25:41,081
made me think twice
about my decision to marry you.

411
00:25:41,164 --> 00:25:43,375
I'm really reconsidering everything now.

412
00:25:43,458 --> 00:25:44,501
No!

413
00:25:44,584 --> 00:25:48,630
You can't leave me!
Don't leave me! Don't leave me!

414
00:25:50,590 --> 00:25:51,925
Don't leave me!

415
00:25:52,717 --> 00:25:55,220
-I'm sorry.
-Arnaldo. Arnaldo.

416
00:25:56,137 --> 00:25:59,933
No… I'm sorry! Sorry! I'm sorry!

417
00:26:01,476 --> 00:26:03,561
[bawling] Sorry! Please, Ivy.

418
00:26:03,645 --> 00:26:07,482
No, Arnaldo!
We should spend some time apart.

419
00:26:08,525 --> 00:26:09,484
[exhales]

420
00:26:09,567 --> 00:26:10,568
Arnaldo…

421
00:26:11,403 --> 00:26:13,655
-No, no, no, no!
-Arnaldo…

422
00:26:14,281 --> 00:26:16,825
-You can't leave me! [sobs]
-Arnaldo, I have to go!

423
00:26:16,908 --> 00:26:19,035
We should spend some time apart.

424
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,663
[Arnaldo sniffles]

425
00:26:21,746 --> 00:26:22,747
Ivy!

426
00:26:24,457 --> 00:26:26,710
[tense music playing]

427
00:26:38,680 --> 00:26:39,931
Ivy…

428
00:26:47,605 --> 00:26:48,690
[phone rings]

429
00:26:54,779 --> 00:26:55,613
Hello?

430
00:26:55,697 --> 00:26:56,948
Ma'am E!

431
00:26:57,032 --> 00:26:58,700
[suspenseful sting]

432
00:26:59,409 --> 00:27:01,703
This is Emilia Ardiente, right?!

433
00:27:02,245 --> 00:27:03,330
Camia?!

434
00:27:03,413 --> 00:27:04,456
[Camia] <i>Don't hang up.</i>

435
00:27:05,332 --> 00:27:07,625
I already know that Nimfa's your spy.

436
00:27:11,087 --> 00:27:13,548
Where is she? What did you do to her?!

437
00:27:14,591 --> 00:27:15,967
You're asking me?

438
00:27:16,926 --> 00:27:19,637
Shouldn't I be asking you that?

439
00:27:21,306 --> 00:27:22,515
Just tell me where she is!

440
00:27:39,240 --> 00:27:42,077
[suspenseful music playing]

441
00:27:48,291 --> 00:27:50,877
[tense music swells]

442
00:27:53,338 --> 00:27:55,965
[Emilia] <i>Why can't you</i>
<i>accept the fact that</i>

443
00:27:56,049 --> 00:28:01,429
<i>Ivy's just playing you?</i>
<i>Who knows? She's with Diego.</i>

444
00:28:05,975 --> 00:28:06,810
[Arnaldo] <i>You're toying with me!</i>

445
00:28:06,893 --> 00:28:08,603
[Ivy] <i>Of course not! No!</i>

446
00:28:08,686 --> 00:28:09,979
[Arnaldo] <i>What's going on between you two?</i>

447
00:28:10,063 --> 00:28:12,023
[Ivy] <i>Diego and I still see each other.</i>

448
00:28:12,107 --> 00:28:13,775
<i>But I told him to stay away.</i>

449
00:28:13,858 --> 00:28:17,153
<i>Because I know I'm sure</i>
<i>of my feelings for you.</i>

450
00:28:17,237 --> 00:28:19,280
<i>Arnaldo, I'm not toying with you.</i>

451
00:28:19,364 --> 00:28:22,075
<i>I love you. I love you, Arnaldo.</i>

452
00:28:28,706 --> 00:28:32,544
[Emilia] <i>You have every</i>
<i>reason to be angry at Ivy.</i>

453
00:28:32,627 --> 00:28:34,629
<i>Does your fiancée really love you?</i>

454
00:28:34,712 --> 00:28:38,425
<i>Or worse, maybe she brought</i>
<i>you here to set you up.</i>

455
00:28:38,508 --> 00:28:39,384
[Arnaldo] <i>Shut up!</i>

456
00:28:39,467 --> 00:28:41,094
[Emilia] <i>Maybe she wants</i>
<i>the people to see you fail!</i>

457
00:28:41,177 --> 00:28:42,345
[Arnaldo] <i>Shut up!</i>

458
00:28:42,429 --> 00:28:45,640
[Emilia] <i>Go ahead… Follow her!</i>

459
00:28:45,724 --> 00:28:49,477
<i>That way, you'll see that</i>
<i>she doesn't really love you.</i>

460
00:28:49,978 --> 00:28:52,397
[Ivy] <i>Arnaldo! Arnaldo, enough!</i>

461
00:28:52,480 --> 00:28:54,274
<i>Arnaldo. I'm all yours.</i>

462
00:28:54,357 --> 00:28:58,653
<i>If you don't believe me,</i>
<i>if you think I'm betraying you,</i>

463
00:28:58,737 --> 00:29:02,407
<i>I guess, Arnaldo… Let's just stop this.</i>

464
00:29:03,658 --> 00:29:05,952
[Ivy] <i>We should call off our wedding.</i>

465
00:29:06,327 --> 00:29:10,081
<i>You just broke my heart, Mr. Mayor.</i>

466
00:29:13,334 --> 00:29:16,588
[tense music swells]

467
00:29:20,341 --> 00:29:24,637
This is the only way to get you
out of our lives, Diego.

468
00:29:34,856 --> 00:29:37,609
[suspenseful music playing]

469
00:29:42,155 --> 00:29:43,156
Ma'am Emilia?

470
00:29:45,742 --> 00:29:46,910
Ma'am Emilia?

471
00:29:48,578 --> 00:29:49,704
Ma'am Emilia?

472
00:29:58,797 --> 00:29:59,923
Ma'am?

473
00:30:05,178 --> 00:30:06,513
Where is she?

474
00:30:08,598 --> 00:30:10,308
Nimfa, where are you?

475
00:30:13,311 --> 00:30:14,854
Ma'am, you have a visitor.

476
00:30:18,566 --> 00:30:19,818
-Ma'am Camia.
-Miss Loring.

477
00:30:19,901 --> 00:30:22,320
Ma'am, I'm sorry for coming unannounced.

478
00:30:22,779 --> 00:30:24,364
I tried calling you.

479
00:30:24,447 --> 00:30:25,949
But I couldn't get a hold of you.

480
00:30:26,032 --> 00:30:28,576
-[Camia] Why--
-Good evening, Ma'am Camia.

481
00:30:29,494 --> 00:30:31,454
I traveled all the way from Bacolod.

482
00:30:31,538 --> 00:30:34,040
I just have a nagging feeling
something's not right.

483
00:30:34,374 --> 00:30:36,584
I'm worried about my daughter, Nimfa.

484
00:30:37,544 --> 00:30:41,130
[suspenseful music swells]

485
00:30:45,718 --> 00:30:46,970
[Nimfa] Ma'am Emilia.

486
00:30:53,560 --> 00:30:54,686
Ma'am?

487
00:31:03,194 --> 00:31:04,195
[Nimfa] Ma'am Emilia?

488
00:31:06,573 --> 00:31:07,615
Mayor Arnaldo!

489
00:31:08,074 --> 00:31:09,200
What are you doing here?

490
00:31:09,284 --> 00:31:10,827
Where is Ma'am Emilia?

491
00:31:10,910 --> 00:31:12,745
I need to tell her something.

492
00:31:14,622 --> 00:31:16,165
You're from the co-op?

493
00:31:18,668 --> 00:31:20,461
So, you're Mom's spy.

494
00:31:21,379 --> 00:31:22,505
Where is she?

495
00:31:22,589 --> 00:31:24,924
I need to tell her something
about Miss Ivy.

496
00:31:25,717 --> 00:31:26,759
Ivy?

497
00:31:29,137 --> 00:31:30,471
What about her?

498
00:31:30,805 --> 00:31:32,974
You shouldn't trust her.

499
00:31:35,226 --> 00:31:39,230
I know you love her, Mayor.
But she's just using you.

500
00:31:39,314 --> 00:31:41,024
That's not true. You're lying.

501
00:31:41,107 --> 00:31:44,986
Mayor, she's the one feeding
information to Diego's camp!

502
00:31:45,069 --> 00:31:47,447
-That's not true!
-She's Diego's spy…

503
00:31:47,530 --> 00:31:49,824
-That's not true!
-within the Ardiente family!

504
00:31:49,908 --> 00:31:51,826
She's just using you.

505
00:31:51,910 --> 00:31:53,202
That's not true!

506
00:31:53,286 --> 00:31:55,246
[Emilia] <i>Ivy's just playing you.</i>

507
00:31:55,330 --> 00:31:56,664
<i>Actually, playing us.</i>

508
00:31:56,748 --> 00:31:58,291
<i>Does your fiancée really love you?</i>

509
00:31:58,374 --> 00:31:59,959
[Nimfa] She's just using you.

510
00:32:00,043 --> 00:32:00,835
That's not--

511
00:32:00,919 --> 00:32:02,670
Mayor, you need to know that Ivy is--

512
00:32:02,754 --> 00:32:04,297
-That's not true!
-[gunshot]

513
00:32:04,380 --> 00:32:05,423
[gunshot in distance]

514
00:32:07,175 --> 00:32:10,178
[Ivy] <i>Damn you, Arnaldo.</i>
<i>I'm not done with you yet.</i>

515
00:32:10,261 --> 00:32:12,430
-[Arnaldo screaming]
-[gunshots]

516
00:32:14,766 --> 00:32:19,729
[suspenseful music swells]

517
00:32:21,689 --> 00:32:23,608
Go back. Go back there.

518
00:32:33,451 --> 00:32:34,494
Mayor!

519
00:32:46,798 --> 00:32:48,091
Clean that up.

520
00:32:55,890 --> 00:32:59,686
[tense music playing]

521
00:33:11,155 --> 00:33:12,407
[Ivy] Arnaldo?

522
00:33:13,616 --> 00:33:14,659
Arnaldo?

523
00:33:17,578 --> 00:33:18,746
Arnaldo?

524
00:33:21,958 --> 00:33:25,586
[suspenseful music playing]

525
00:33:31,467 --> 00:33:32,802
Arnaldo!

526
00:33:42,103 --> 00:33:45,690
[suspenseful music continues playing]

527
00:33:48,609 --> 00:33:49,694
Arnaldo!

528
00:33:52,405 --> 00:33:56,743
I heard gunshots. I thought--

529
00:33:56,826 --> 00:33:58,369
I thought you left me for good.

530
00:34:00,580 --> 00:34:03,207
But you came back for me.
Were you worried about me?

531
00:34:09,756 --> 00:34:10,757
Ivy.

532
00:34:12,842 --> 00:34:14,093
Take back your ring.

533
00:34:15,678 --> 00:34:16,971
Please take back your ring.

534
00:34:17,055 --> 00:34:18,097
And let's just forget…

535
00:34:18,181 --> 00:34:20,183
-about everything that happened.
-No, Arnaldo.

536
00:34:20,266 --> 00:34:21,267
No.

537
00:34:22,602 --> 00:34:26,606
Not until you change.
We'll just keep doing this.

538
00:34:26,689 --> 00:34:28,858
[Arnaldo] You can't refuse
me anymore. All right?

539
00:34:29,984 --> 00:34:31,527
-You will take this ring…
-Arnaldo.

540
00:34:31,611 --> 00:34:33,029
And you will marry me
whether you like it--

541
00:34:33,112 --> 00:34:34,197
Arnaldo!

542
00:34:34,697 --> 00:34:35,573
Ahh!

543
00:34:36,824 --> 00:34:38,326
[motorcycle approaching]

544
00:34:44,207 --> 00:34:45,208
Sir.

545
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:47,418
Is Nimfa there?

546
00:34:47,502 --> 00:34:48,503
The one from the co-op?

547
00:34:49,587 --> 00:34:51,672
She's this tall and slender.

548
00:34:51,756 --> 00:34:53,716
We haven't had any visitors, sir.

549
00:34:55,676 --> 00:34:56,928
Stop it!

550
00:35:00,348 --> 00:35:02,517
Don't you see it, hmm?

551
00:35:03,518 --> 00:35:06,479
See, I'm the only one
who believes in your stories.

552
00:35:06,896 --> 00:35:10,191
Or should I say, lies?
I keep looking the other way

553
00:35:10,274 --> 00:35:12,151
because I'm blinded by my love for you.

554
00:35:13,611 --> 00:35:16,197
You've constantly made a fool out of me.

555
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:20,827
But I just accept it. Because I love you.

556
00:35:22,411 --> 00:35:24,288
I love you so much.

557
00:35:26,332 --> 00:35:29,627
Why? What did you find out?

558
00:35:33,297 --> 00:35:34,632
Maybe she's inside.

559
00:35:35,675 --> 00:35:36,884
No one came, sir.

560
00:35:42,390 --> 00:35:43,516
Thank you.

561
00:35:43,891 --> 00:35:45,017
Okay.

562
00:35:53,568 --> 00:35:55,570
[engine revving]

563
00:35:59,532 --> 00:36:02,410
From now on, everything will change.

564
00:36:03,995 --> 00:36:07,331
You will love me. You will marry me.

565
00:36:07,748 --> 00:36:09,834
And you won't have any other choice.

566
00:36:11,169 --> 00:36:12,753
What did you learn?

567
00:36:12,837 --> 00:36:13,880
Okay.

568
00:36:15,965 --> 00:36:16,966
You really wanna know?

569
00:36:18,217 --> 00:36:19,760
Then let's start with…

570
00:36:21,637 --> 00:36:25,641
how you're the one supporting
and helping finance

571
00:36:25,725 --> 00:36:29,020
the case Camia filed
against the Ardientes.

572
00:36:30,563 --> 00:36:31,731
And, oh!

573
00:36:32,690 --> 00:36:34,901
You also help in Diego's campaign.

574
00:36:34,984 --> 00:36:36,861
What a freaking surprise.

575
00:36:38,988 --> 00:36:40,406
Ivy Aguas.

576
00:36:41,782 --> 00:36:44,869
You're a traitor to the Ardientes.

577
00:36:46,871 --> 00:36:48,206
And, most importantly,

578
00:36:50,041 --> 00:36:55,171
you betrayed the man
you said you were in love with.

579
00:36:56,088 --> 00:36:58,090
[tense music continues playing]

580
00:37:06,557 --> 00:37:07,600
That's not true.

581
00:37:08,142 --> 00:37:08,935
Isn't it?

582
00:37:09,018 --> 00:37:10,102
Yes.

583
00:37:10,186 --> 00:37:11,729
Well, how can you deny it?

584
00:37:11,812 --> 00:37:14,941
That's what Mom's spy said earlier.

585
00:37:15,900 --> 00:37:17,068
How do I know?

586
00:37:17,151 --> 00:37:21,530
Because right at this very spot,

587
00:37:23,574 --> 00:37:25,910
Nimfa dropped dead.

588
00:37:29,538 --> 00:37:30,706
That's right.

589
00:37:31,707 --> 00:37:34,001
I killed her.

590
00:37:37,255 --> 00:37:41,300
After she told me everything you'd done.

591
00:37:45,805 --> 00:37:47,807
You killed Nimfa?

592
00:37:49,642 --> 00:37:50,685
Well…

593
00:37:51,394 --> 00:37:54,480
My mind is telling me
to believe her, but my heart…

594
00:37:56,607 --> 00:37:58,359
This… this thing…

595
00:37:59,485 --> 00:38:02,405
This thing refuses
to take orders from anyone.

596
00:38:06,409 --> 00:38:07,702
That's why I killed her.

597
00:38:13,457 --> 00:38:15,459
[crickets chirping]

598
00:38:16,085 --> 00:38:17,169
Miss Loring, Mister Fernan…

599
00:38:17,253 --> 00:38:18,170
-Diego's here.
-Nanny.

600
00:38:18,254 --> 00:38:19,171
Mister Fernan.

601
00:38:19,255 --> 00:38:20,298
[Loring] Diego!

602
00:38:20,381 --> 00:38:23,592
Did you find Nimfa?
Is she with the Ardientes?

603
00:38:24,677 --> 00:38:25,428
[Fernan] Why…

604
00:38:25,511 --> 00:38:26,929
What's she doing with Emilia?

605
00:38:27,013 --> 00:38:29,390
She works here, right?

606
00:38:32,059 --> 00:38:34,103
Is there something you're not telling me?

607
00:38:35,313 --> 00:38:36,689
Did something happen to my daughter?

608
00:38:37,815 --> 00:38:39,734
[Loring] Diego, what's happening?

609
00:38:40,234 --> 00:38:42,111
Please tell us.

610
00:38:42,194 --> 00:38:44,864
[tense music playing]

611
00:38:44,947 --> 00:38:46,449
Nimfa is my friend.

612
00:38:47,325 --> 00:38:49,368
So, I couldn't believe
what happened, either.

613
00:38:50,494 --> 00:38:51,579
[Loring] What?

614
00:38:53,497 --> 00:38:55,333
Nimfa is Emilia's spy.

615
00:38:55,708 --> 00:38:58,336
She was bribed with
money and other things.

616
00:38:58,794 --> 00:39:03,007
Emilia told her to spy on our
party and sabotage my campaign.

617
00:39:03,799 --> 00:39:06,886
No. My daughter wouldn't do that!

618
00:39:07,845 --> 00:39:09,180
[Fernan] Where's Nimfa? Nimfa!

619
00:39:09,263 --> 00:39:10,389
[Diego] Mister Fernan.

620
00:39:10,473 --> 00:39:12,350
-[Fernan] Nimfa!
-Mister Fernan.

621
00:39:13,309 --> 00:39:14,727
Your daughter was here a while ago,

622
00:39:14,810 --> 00:39:16,979
but she went to Emilia.

623
00:39:17,688 --> 00:39:19,482
She hasn't come back yet.

624
00:39:20,232 --> 00:39:23,319
[tense music playing]

625
00:39:23,402 --> 00:39:24,612
[Fernan] Loring.

626
00:39:26,113 --> 00:39:27,990
-My daughter!
-[Loring] Fernan.

627
00:39:31,243 --> 00:39:33,120
Mister Fernan, we'll get
to the bottom of this.

628
00:39:34,455 --> 00:39:35,623
Be strong.

629
00:39:44,090 --> 00:39:46,175
So, here's what's going to happen.

630
00:39:50,096 --> 00:39:50,971
[huffs]

631
00:39:51,055 --> 00:39:52,431
We'll push through with the wedding.

632
00:39:53,724 --> 00:39:55,976
Because your whole act
will be for nothing…

633
00:39:58,229 --> 00:40:00,398
if we don't have our royal wedding.

634
00:40:01,023 --> 00:40:03,776
[tense music playing]

635
00:40:06,112 --> 00:40:07,363
Wait, wait…

636
00:40:07,446 --> 00:40:08,739
You're upset again!

637
00:40:09,490 --> 00:40:11,909
I don't like it when you're upset, please.

638
00:40:12,535 --> 00:40:16,831
Please. Please. We're getting married.

639
00:40:16,914 --> 00:40:20,167
I love you so much. I love you so much.

640
00:40:21,877 --> 00:40:22,795
[sniffles]

641
00:40:22,878 --> 00:40:24,713
I love you so much, please.

642
00:40:28,384 --> 00:40:30,719
Please. I love you!

643
00:40:31,804 --> 00:40:33,139
[bawling]

644
00:40:34,890 --> 00:40:37,476
I love you. Ivy, I love you.

645
00:40:38,018 --> 00:40:40,479
Ivy! I love you so much!

646
00:40:42,314 --> 00:40:46,694
Please, don't let me down.
I killed for you.

647
00:40:48,362 --> 00:40:50,573
I killed for you. What more do you want?

648
00:40:50,656 --> 00:40:51,866
I killed for you!

649
00:40:54,368 --> 00:40:55,619
That's how much I love you, Ivy.

650
00:40:55,703 --> 00:40:58,414
Anything for you!
I love you so much, please!

651
00:40:59,165 --> 00:41:02,376
Please, don't let me down! Please!

652
00:41:05,129 --> 00:41:06,297
Please!

653
00:41:08,799 --> 00:41:11,051
We will only get married…

654
00:41:13,387 --> 00:41:15,556
if you believe me…

655
00:41:17,641 --> 00:41:20,144
when I say I'm not
a traitor to your family.

656
00:41:21,312 --> 00:41:23,439
I need my name cleared

657
00:41:23,522 --> 00:41:26,901
because I'm not a traitor to your family.

658
00:41:29,028 --> 00:41:33,574
You need to believe me, Arnaldo,
not that farmhand.

659
00:41:34,700 --> 00:41:37,870
If you believe me, we'll get married.

660
00:41:40,498 --> 00:41:42,958
I-- I believe you.

661
00:41:44,502 --> 00:41:46,170
I-- I believe you.

662
00:41:46,253 --> 00:41:48,172
I-- Ivy, I believe you!

663
00:41:48,255 --> 00:41:50,841
I believe you. I believe you.

664
00:41:50,925 --> 00:41:52,718
I believe everything that you say.

665
00:41:53,844 --> 00:41:56,722
Ivy, that's it. I believe you.

666
00:41:58,724 --> 00:41:59,934
I believe you.

667
00:42:03,229 --> 00:42:04,355
I believe you.

668
00:42:06,774 --> 00:42:08,442
That's all I need.

669
00:42:09,860 --> 00:42:11,946
I need you to trust me.

670
00:42:12,613 --> 00:42:14,198
That's all, Arnaldo.

671
00:42:15,449 --> 00:42:16,867
I'm not a traitor.

672
00:42:17,910 --> 00:42:19,537
Do you believe me?

673
00:42:19,954 --> 00:42:21,080
I do.

674
00:42:23,499 --> 00:42:24,917
I believe you.

675
00:42:27,753 --> 00:42:29,255
I love you so much.

676
00:42:31,549 --> 00:42:33,384
And I'll marry you again.

677
00:42:33,842 --> 00:42:36,512
We're going through with the wedding.

678
00:42:40,182 --> 00:42:41,100
[sniffles]

679
00:42:41,183 --> 00:42:43,018
We're going through
with the wedding, okay?

680
00:42:43,102 --> 00:42:44,562
-Yes.
-We're getting married, right?

681
00:42:44,645 --> 00:42:45,646
Yes.

682
00:42:50,901 --> 00:42:53,821
[tense music playing]

683
00:43:02,955 --> 00:43:04,623
But wait, Arnaldo…

684
00:43:09,086 --> 00:43:13,340
I need time to process all this.

685
00:43:14,425 --> 00:43:19,388
You need to take some time too.
I'm worried about you.

686
00:43:21,015 --> 00:43:23,350
You're not a murderer.

687
00:43:24,226 --> 00:43:26,854
How are you going to cover up
what you did to Nimfa?

688
00:43:28,105 --> 00:43:29,315
[stammering]

689
00:43:29,398 --> 00:43:31,442
That's nothing. You don't need
to worry about that.

690
00:43:32,484 --> 00:43:33,611
I've taken care of it.

691
00:43:34,069 --> 00:43:35,988
I know exactly who should take the fall,

692
00:43:36,071 --> 00:43:37,823
so don't worry. Don't worry!

693
00:43:37,906 --> 00:43:39,074
Don't worry about me.

694
00:43:39,742 --> 00:43:42,328
I'll be fine! I'll be fine.

695
00:43:43,454 --> 00:43:44,830
Don't worry about me.

696
00:43:51,920 --> 00:43:56,175
[tense music swells]

697
00:44:16,987 --> 00:44:17,988
<i>Hon?</i>

698
00:44:18,697 --> 00:44:20,032
[Diego] <i>Arnaldo.</i>

699
00:44:20,115 --> 00:44:21,742
<i>-Hon.</i>
<i>-We're not doing anything wrong.</i>

700
00:44:21,825 --> 00:44:24,453
-[Diego grunts]
-[Ivy] <i>Arnaldo! Arnaldo, enough!</i>

701
00:44:32,002 --> 00:44:33,379
Ah…

702
00:44:33,462 --> 00:44:36,215
An angel just flew over us!

703
00:44:37,508 --> 00:44:38,759
[Julio chuckles]

704
00:44:39,093 --> 00:44:40,260
Or at least,

705
00:44:40,344 --> 00:44:42,680
I think that's what people say

706
00:44:42,763 --> 00:44:48,185
when silence befalls
a gathering like this.

707
00:44:49,520 --> 00:44:51,480
But, then again, with this family…

708
00:44:52,231 --> 00:44:54,108
I don't think that's applicable.

709
00:44:54,775 --> 00:44:56,068
It's more like…

710
00:44:57,236 --> 00:44:59,947
a demon passed by!

711
00:45:01,198 --> 00:45:02,282
[chuckles]

712
00:45:03,700 --> 00:45:08,163
Because I can only think
of wicked things and thoughts…

713
00:45:09,039 --> 00:45:14,044
that are running within each
and every mind at this table.

714
00:45:15,337 --> 00:45:16,338
Well, Emilia…

715
00:45:18,257 --> 00:45:21,301
Would you care to share
your evil thoughts?

716
00:45:23,053 --> 00:45:24,179
No, Papa.

717
00:45:27,015 --> 00:45:28,475
[Julio] How about you, Arnaldo?

718
00:45:29,393 --> 00:45:34,523
What ungodly secret is running
through your head right now?

719
00:45:35,774 --> 00:45:40,612
Nothing, Grandpa. That secret
shall reveal itself very soon.

720
00:45:41,864 --> 00:45:47,411
But, is everything okay between
you and your future wife?

721
00:45:51,165 --> 00:45:54,501
[tense music swells]

722
00:46:02,217 --> 00:46:04,845
Excuse me, I'll just use the restroom.

723
00:46:07,347 --> 00:46:08,515
[Julio sighs]

724
00:46:10,017 --> 00:46:11,935
I didn't know I had that effect.

725
00:46:15,814 --> 00:46:20,110
Well, I'm done. Excuse me.

726
00:46:22,905 --> 00:46:24,281
Me too.

727
00:46:24,364 --> 00:46:27,659
I am still head of this family!

728
00:46:28,827 --> 00:46:30,370
The least you can do…

729
00:46:31,079 --> 00:46:34,708
is tell me what the hell is going on.

730
00:46:38,504 --> 00:46:39,630
Okay, Papa…

731
00:46:41,507 --> 00:46:47,387
I'm worried because my spy
hasn't checked in with me yet.

732
00:46:48,055 --> 00:46:50,766
I'm afraid she might have turned on me.

733
00:46:53,477 --> 00:46:54,478
Arnaldo.

734
00:46:56,480 --> 00:46:58,106
Did you have anything to do with this?

735
00:47:02,778 --> 00:47:05,113
Well, I guess there's no point
in keeping it a secret.

736
00:47:08,158 --> 00:47:10,702
Nimfa is dead, and I killed her.

737
00:47:12,704 --> 00:47:13,705
Oh, my--

738
00:47:16,792 --> 00:47:19,836
[tense music playing]

739
00:47:23,131 --> 00:47:24,758
[lock clicking]

740
00:47:33,642 --> 00:47:34,601
[phone rings]

741
00:47:38,522 --> 00:47:39,523
[phone rings]

742
00:47:40,482 --> 00:47:41,316
Hello, Ivy?

743
00:47:42,276 --> 00:47:43,485
Diego…

744
00:47:45,112 --> 00:47:48,031
Diego-- Diego, something
happened to Nimfa.

745
00:47:50,033 --> 00:47:51,076
What--

746
00:47:51,785 --> 00:47:54,580
Ivy-- Ivy, what happened to her?

747
00:47:56,373 --> 00:47:57,416
Diego, she's…

748
00:47:58,959 --> 00:48:00,502
She's dead.

749
00:48:03,714 --> 00:48:05,340
Arnaldo killed her.

750
00:48:05,882 --> 00:48:08,343
[tense music swells]

751
00:48:17,019 --> 00:48:19,104
-[Fernan] <i>Nimfa! Nimfa!</i>
-[Loring screams]

752
00:48:19,187 --> 00:48:20,188
-[Diego] <i>Mr. Fernan!</i>
-[Fernan] <i>Nimfa!</i>

753
00:48:20,272 --> 00:48:22,733
<i>Why did they kill my daughter?</i>

754
00:48:22,816 --> 00:48:24,526
[Diego] <i>Their day will come.</i>

755
00:48:24,610 --> 00:48:26,528
[man] <i>This is solid evidence, Mr. Torillo.</i>

756
00:48:26,612 --> 00:48:28,280
<i>We'll raid this armory</i>
<i>as soon as possible.</i>

757
00:48:28,363 --> 00:48:29,865
[goon] <i>Congressman, someone's coming.</i>

758
00:48:29,948 --> 00:48:31,283
-[gunshots]
-<i>They're armed.</i>

759
00:48:31,366 --> 00:48:33,035
<i>Special Forces from Manila.</i>

760
00:48:34,077 --> 00:48:36,538
[police officer] <i>Mr. Torillo, we</i>
<i>have a warrant for your arrest</i>

761
00:48:36,622 --> 00:48:38,665
<i>for the murder of Nimfa Naig.</i>

762
00:48:38,749 --> 00:48:39,750
